/-!
# S3139: first-triangle route conclusion (consumer re-export)

Re-exports the conclusion of @firstTriangleRouteComposition@ in a form route
consumers can plug directly: after the certified C3 closure the only hypotheses
are the route residual data (M0/M1/stage4) and the fourth-triangle arithmetic
inputs.

**Component, not paper object.**  Registry frozen except approved re-pins.
No sorry/axiom/True/PUnit/toy carrier.
-/

namespace LeanFormal.IUT.XiFPaper.S3139FirstTriangleRouteConclusionActual

open LeanFormal.IUT
open LeanFormal.IUT.Theorem311Source
